            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Committee on Safeguards",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.749,
                0.171,
                0.882,
                0.187
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Original: English",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "doc_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.236,
                0.228,
                0.762,
                0.27
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "NOTIFICATION UNDER ARTICLE 12.1(A) OF THE AGREEMENT ON SAFEGUARDS ON INITIATION OF AN INVESTIGATION AND THE REASONS FOR IT"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.448,
                0.283,
                0.551,
                0.298
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "SOUTH AFRICA",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.326,
                0.317,
                0.675,
                0.332
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Certain cold-rolled products of iron and steel",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.115,
                0.351,
                0.883,
                0.38
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "The following communication, dated and received on 14 July 2026, is being circulated at the request of the delegation of South Africa.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.114,
                0.433,
                0.884,
                0.501
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Pursuant to Article 12.1(a) of the Agreement on Safeguards, South Africa hereby gives notification of the initiation of a safeguard investigation on the imports of flat-rolled products of iron, non-alloy steel or other alloy steel (not including stainless steel), whether in coils or not in coils, (including products cut-to-length and 'narrow strip'), not further worked than cold-rolled (cold-reduced), not clad, plated or coated (herewith referred to as cold-rolled products).",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.117,
                0.512,
                0.561,
                0.528
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. The date when the investigation was initiated"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.115,
                0.54,
                0.883,
                0.569
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "The investigation was initiated on 10 July 2026. The notice of initiation by the investigating authority was published through Notice 416 of 2026 in Government Gazette No 54970 on 10 July 2026. \\( ^{1} \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.117,
                0.58,
                0.511,
                0.596
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. The product subject to the investigation"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.115,
                0.607,
                0.883,
                0.675
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "The subject product is described as flat-rolled products of iron, non-alloy steel or other alloy steel (not including stainless steel), whether in coils or not in coils, (including products cut-to-length and 'narrow strip'), not further worked than cold-rolled (cold-reduced), not clad, plated or coated, imported under tariff subheading 7209.15, 7209.16, 7209.17, 7209.18, 7209.25, 7209.26, 7209.27, 7209.90, 7211.23, 7211.29, 7211.90 and 7225.50.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.116,
                0.687,
                0.557,
                0.702
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. The reasons for the initiation of investigation"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.114,
                0.714,
                0.883,
                0.755
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "The application was lodged by ArcelorMittal South Africa Ltd (\"AMSA\" or the \"Applicant\"). They are the only producer of the subject product in the SACU region and therefore constitute 100% of the SACU domestic production of the subject product.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.114,
                0.767,
                0.883,
                0.809
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "The claim is that the subject product is being imported into the SACU market in such increasing quantities in absolute terms and relative to SACU production and under such conditions, to be causing serious injury to the SACU industry.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.114,
                0.82,
                0.883,
                0.862
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "The Commission found that the applicant submitted prima facie information to indicate that the volumes of cold-rolled products increased sharply both in absolute terms and relative to domestic production in the 2024 (01 January 2024 to 31 December 2024) period.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "bbox": [
                0.115,
                0.89,
                0.876,
                0.917
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\( ^{1} \\)  A copy of the notice of initiation has also been submitted electronically and is available to government representatives. To consult it, please contact Ms Anne Richards of the Rules Division (anne.richards@wto.org)"
        },
